  "outcome_tuned": false,
  "purpose": "H4 separates model extraction of unresolved-decision graph facts from deterministic parent-owned root selection. It is a qualification proposal, not evidence of routing quality or runtime behavior.",
  "novelty_statement": "Unlike H3 independent eligibility, H4 represents controller-to-downstream dependencies among the same four frozen decision slots and selects only unresolved roots. The proposal is novel only at the structural resolver layer and makes no outcome, efficacy, runtime, provider, or product claim.",
